    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843650/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1718734828\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843650/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1718734828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Play as a higher dimensional being and pick up the flat things and put them in other places, or even on top of each other. Destroy the hordes of uncarded abominations coming after your cards.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real Time with Pause<br><br></li><li>Put cards together to get buildings or more resources.<br><br></li><li>Recruit followers to defend your base and grow your cult.<br><br></li><li>Hearts, diamonds, shovels, spades, each represent a vital aspect in your rituals. <br><br></li><li>Tend to your garden between runs, plant souls and harvest upgrades.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843650/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1718734828\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843650/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1718734828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Play as a higher dimensional being and pick up the flat things and put them in other places, or even on top of each other. Destroy the hordes of uncarded abominations coming after your cards.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real Time with Pause<br><br></li><li>Put cards together to get buildings or more resources.<br><br></li><li>Recruit followers to defend your base and grow your cult.<br><br></li><li>Hearts, diamonds, shovels, spades, each represent a vital aspect in your rituals. <br><br></li><li>Tend to your garden between runs, plant souls and harvest upgrades.</li></ul>",
